<title>HONG KONG: New World Dev falls on placement rumour.</title>
<headline>New World Dev falls on placement rumour.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of property developer New World Development Co Ltd fell in morning trade on rumours the company is planning a share placement, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Talk that the company is planning a share placement triggered fears of possible dilution but the market has no details so far,&quot; said a dealing director at a regional brokerage.</p>
<p>New World shares fell HK$0.50, or 1.29 percent, to HK$38.40 in late morning trade on volume of 3.12 million shares.</p>
<p>New World officials were unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
